@startuml statechart-reservation
' Reservation lifecycle (FR-13, FR-15..FR-18, FR-25..FR-28)
[*] --> Active : createReservation [valid period, item operational,\nnot under maintenance, not checked out,\nno overlap, < 3 active, <= 7 days]
Active --> Cancelled : cancelReservation [requested by owner]
Active --> Expired : expireOverdue [now >= min(end, start + pickupWindow)]
Active --> CheckedOut : checkOut [admin, start <= now < pickupDeadline,\nitem operational, no open maintenance]
CheckedOut --> Completed : returnItem(condition) [admin]
CheckedOut : overdue when now > end (listed, never auto-closed)
Cancelled --> [*]
Expired --> [*]
Completed --> [*]
note right of Active : blocks availability
note right of CheckedOut : blocks availability
@enduml
